Gladys Mobile Alerts integration
Copyright 2026 William-De71

This product includes software developed for Gladys Assistant.

The measurements come from the Mobile Alerts sensors of the user, through the
official Mobile Alerts REST API (https://www.data199.com/api/pv1, documented at
https://mobile-alerts.eu/info/public_server_api_documentation.pdf).
Data provided by Mobile Alerts.

The measurements of test/helpers/fake-api.js are built after the examples of
that documentation.

